  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">One view of the whole picture</div>
        <h2>A complete, independent view of the Caribbean opportunity.</h2>
        <p>Rather than represent a single development or program, Dan evaluates every Caribbean citizenship and residency route, and the region's CBI-approved and luxury developments — and recommends only what fits your objectives.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="vp-grid">
        <div class="vp"><div class="vp-i">i</div><h3>Citizenship &amp; Residency</h3><p>Unbiased guidance across the Caribbean's citizenship and residency programs.</p></div>
        <div class="vp"><div class="vp-i">ii</div><h3>Caribbean Real Estate</h3><p>CBI-approved property and luxury branded residences across the Eastern Caribbean.</p></div>
        <div class="vp"><div class="vp-i">iii</div><h3>Tax &amp; Wealth Planning</h3><p>Cross-border tax, offshore trusts, companies and banking — structured around your move.</p></div>
        <div class="vp"><div class="vp-i">iv</div><h3>Local Expertise</h3><p>Based in the Eastern Caribbean — walking the land and meeting developers in person.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

