  <section class="dan">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="portrait"><img src="https://www.danmerriam.com/assets/dan-portrait.jpg" alt="Dan Merriam, arms folded, on a terrace above the Caribbean" width="724" height="1086" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Meet Dan Merriam</div>
        <div class="role">Caribbean real estate &amp; investment migration advisor</div>
        <h2>Almost two decades in real estate — on-the-ground knowledge and expertise.</h2>
        <p>I help global families, entrepreneurs, and investors keep wealth, secure second citizenship and residency, and find genuine lifestyle freedom in the Caribbean. With almost two decades in real estate and cross-border strategy, I help clients invest and live in this region with the detail that only comes from doing it here — I made the same move myself and hold my own second citizenship.</p>
        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat"><div class="n">100+</div><div class="l">families guided to citizenship<br>&amp; residency in the past 18 months</div></div>
          <div class="stat"><div class="n">US$75M+</div><div class="l">in transactions across the<br>region in the past 18 months</div></div>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:26px;"><a class="btn btn-line-dark" href="about">Read Dan's Story</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="collab" id="collaboration">
    <div class="wrap logorow brands">
