  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="split">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Second citizenship</div>
          <h2>A passport is a decision about where your family's future is safe.</h2>
          <p>Five years ago this market was built on families from places with obvious reasons to leave. Today the calls come from families who never expected to need a second option — and none of them are approaching it casually. A Caribbean program can deliver mobility, tax efficiency and an asset you actually own.</p>
          <ul class="checklist">
            <li>Visa-free or visa-on-arrival access of 155 destinations on a St. Kitts &amp; Nevis passport, 154 on Antigua &amp; Barbuda, 147 on Grenada, and 145 on Dominica and St. Lucia (2026)</li>
            <li>No local tax on worldwide income, capital gains or inheritance &mdash; though US citizens remain taxed by the United States on worldwide income regardless of a second citizenship</li>
            <li>Real-estate routes that can be resold after the hold period</li>
            <li>Citizenship that passes to future generations</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href="citizenship-by-investment">Compare the Five Programs</a>
        </div>
        <div class="art"><img src="https://www.danmerriam.com/assets/passport-stamps.jpg" alt="A passport open at a page dense with entry and exit stamps" width="900" height="506" loading="lazy"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="advisory">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Private client</div>
        <h2 style="color:var(--ivory);">Building wealth is one skill. Diversifying it across borders is another.</h2>
        <p>For families and family offices, the practice builds the structure around the purchase &mdash; the trust, the holding company, the banking, and the order those have to happen in.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="adv-grid">
        <a class="adv-card" href="/services/offshore-trusts-and-foundations"><h3>Offshore Structures</h3><p>Trusts, foundations and companies designed for protection and succession.</p></a>
        <a class="adv-card" href="international-tax-planning"><h3>International Tax</h3><p>Cross-border planning aligned to your citizenship and residency.</p></a>
        <a class="adv-card" href="/services/family-office-services"><h3>Banking &amp; Family Office</h3><p>Account opening at the banks that still take non-resident files, and someone on the ground when a wire stalls.</p></a>
      </div>
